<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill yields creep higher at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill yields creep higher at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield of all maturities of Latvian T-bills rose slightly at auction on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD(pct) LAST WEEK NO OF BANKS ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.70	  3.70	 2	   0.75  0.95   0.75</p>
<p> Three-month  5.84	  5.73	 6	   1.50  1.93   1.50</p>
<p> Six-month    6.24	  6.17	 8	   2.0   3.5    2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
